WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.434
We are in front of Stever House,

2
00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:05.205
which is a first year
residence hall with about 250 residents.

3
00:00:05.672 --> 00:00:10.076
In total, CMU has 26 residence
halls, apartments and communities.

4
00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:14.147
This includes 17 sorority
and fraternity houses and 14 buildings

5
00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.515
dedicated for first years.

6
00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.550
First years are required to live on campus,

7
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.652
and we do guarantee
housing for the duration

8
00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:23.123
of your undergraduate program,
whether that be four years or five years.

9
00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.657
We have a couple of neighborhoods

10
00:00:24.657 --> 00:00:27.060
and right now we are
in the Morewood neighborhood.

11
00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.062
In addition to that,
we have Margaret Morrison,

12
00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:32.499
which is behind Highmark and Fifth
Avenue, which is about one street away.

13
00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.534
There's a couple of housing styles here.

14
00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:37.303
We have the traditional,
which is just two people in a room

15
00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:40.540
with shared bathrooms in the halls,
which are cleaned daily by staff.

16
00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.411
We also have a semi-suite style room
where 2 to 3 rooms share a bathroom,

17
00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.646
but you have to
clean that bathroom yourself.

18
00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:50.817
We also have an apartment style room
with double/triple rooms

19
00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.286
and a private bathroom and kitchen,
just like an apartment.

20
00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:56.656
Before we enter, I would like to note
that current students do live here.

21
00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.058
So please don't take pictures.

22
00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.393
And we won't be going into
the bathrooms here either.

